  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WHO Making Health Adaptation for the Future Resilient Islands - Kiribati Outer Islands for Climate Health Action</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Governance capacity strengthened to support sustainable health adaptation; infrastructure resilience to climate change is increased in healthcare facilities, schools, and communities in vulnerable outer islands; health service delivery at primary health care level is resilient to climate change; communities are engaged and empowered with knowledge and tools to take adaptive actions to reduce the health risks of climate change</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objectives of this project is to strengthen health systems, schools, healthcare facilities and communities with an emphasis on outer islands in Kiribati to protect and improve population health in a changing climate.&#xC9C0;&#xC18D;&#xAC00;&#xB2A5;&#xD55C; &#xBCF4;&#xAC74; &#xC801;&#xC751;&#xB825; &#xC9C0;&#xC6D0;&#xC744; &#xC704;&#xD55C; &#xAC15;&#xD654;&#xB41C; &#xC815;&#xBD80;&#xC758; &#xC5ED;&#xB7C9;/ &#xC758;&#xB8CC;&#xC2DC;&#xC124;, &#xD559;&#xAD50;, &#xC9C0;&#xC5ED;&#xC0AC;&#xD68C;&#xC5D0;&#xC11C;&#xC758; &#xAE30;&#xD6C4;&#xBCC0;&#xD654;&#xC5D0; &#xB300;&#xD55C; &#xC99D;&#xB300;&#xB41C; &#xC778;&#xD504;&#xB77C;, &#xAE30;&#xD6C4; &#xBCC0;&#xD654;&#xC5D0; &#xB300;&#xD55C; &#xC77C;&#xCC28; &#xC758;&#xB8CC;&#xCF00;&#xC5B4;&#xC5D0;&#xC11C;&#xC758; &#xC758;&#xB8CC; &#xC11C;&#xBE44;&#xC2A4; &#xC81C;&#xACF5;&#xC758; &#xD0C4;&#xB825;&#xC131;, &#xAE30;&#xD6C4; &#xBCC0;&#xD654; &#xBCF4;&#xAC74; &#xC704;&#xD5D8; &#xACBD;&#xAC10;&#xC744; &#xC704;&#xD55C; &#xC9C0;&#xC2DD;&#xACFC; &#xB3C4;&#xAD6C;&#xB97C; &#xAC16;&#xCD98; &#xC9C0;&#xC5ED;&#xC0AC;&#xD68C;</narrative>
